<title>UK: Greycoat to sell property for 6.4 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Greycoat to sell property for 6.4 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greycoat Plc said it has exchanged contracts to sell two freeholds in London for a total of 6.4 million stg.</p>
<p>The property is being sold to discretionary clients of Baring Houston and Saunders.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
